        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-02T13:51:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.&nbsp;</p><p>I had everyone focus on AZ round 1, including having Tempest unload on him with multiple slashes. He Was at 3 HP on Akash's 2nd turn, and she finished him off with an Entomb.&nbsp;</p><p>After that, it was a steady game. No environment, and we methodically pounded her into dust. She had a nasty round at the end with a primeval eruption bringing out multiple rockslides, but without any ability to play cards during the environment turn, it was nothing we couldn't handle.&nbsp;</p>",
